"F01230"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/BenchmarkEngine.cs"	"24"	"100"	"MethodDeclaration"	"BenchmarkEngine.public static async Task<BenchmarkReport> RunPreparedAsync(string folder, BenchmarkProfile profile, BenchmarkPreparedWorkloadExecutor operation, IProgress<BenchmarkProgress>? progress = null, TimeProvider? timeProvider = null, ILog? log = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"RunPreparedAsync: validates folder/profile before any work; warm-up runs and baseline metrics snapshot are excluded from samples (Iterations counts only timed samples); cancellation rethrown, other failures logged then rethrown; samples.Count==0 cannot occur because Validate requires Iterations>=1 and the InsufficientData branch is defensive; elapsed uses injected TimeProvider.GetElapsedTime so no double-rounding; folder is only checked for existence and echoed in the report, never written to. Covered by BenchmarkEngineTimingTests.RunPreparedAsync_SamplesExcludePrepareTime / RunPreparedAsync_MetricsExcludeWarmup. Minor: StartedUtc uses DateTimeOffset.UtcNow while samples use TimeProvider (cosmetic) and Fail/Warn Message text is also set for InsufficientData (unreachable)."
"F01231"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/BenchmarkEngine.cs"	"103"	"103"	"MethodDeclaration"	"BenchmarkEngine.private static string Ms(double value)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Ms: value.ToString(""F1"", InvariantCulture) so log lines never use the Vietnamese decimal comma (CA1305); NaN/Infinity would print as symbols but inputs are finite elapsed ms or P50 of empty set = 0 (BenchmarkStatistics.Percentile returns 0 for empty). Covered by BenchmarkEngineTimingTests.RunPreparedAsync_LogUsesInvariantDecimals."
"F01232"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/BenchmarkImageExecutor.cs"	"28"	"48"	"ConstructorDeclaration"	"BenchmarkImageExecutor.public BenchmarkImageExecutor(BenchmarkProfile profile, string[] files, Func<double, bool>? hasHeadroom = null)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Ctor: scratch disk cache dir is Path.GetTempPath()/PhotoReview-Benchmark-Cache/<Guid> so benchmark never reads/writes the real %LocalAppData% preview cache; disableDiskCacheOverride=!profile.DiskCache disables persistence; WindowedPreloadTarget receives the profile windows (PERF-01); FullFolderThresholdBytes is 0 for non-FullFolder profiles so no whole-folder escalation; files[] empty is accepted (Array.ConvertAll of empty). Covered by BenchmarkTrustTests.Executor_HonorsNextAndPreviousWindow / Executor_ZeroWindowWarmsNoNeighbours / Executor_FullFolderControlsWholeFolderWarming."
"F01233"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/BenchmarkImageExecutor.cs"	"33"	"33"	"ParenthesizedLambdaExpression"	"BenchmarkImageExecutor.lambda in initializer"	"UNREVIEWED"	""
