"F01250"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/BenchmarkImageExecutor.cs"	"206"	"213"	"ConstructorDeclaration"	"WindowedPreloadTarget.public WindowedPreloadTarget(IPreloadTarget inner, string[] files, BenchmarkProfile profile)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"WindowedPreloadTarget ctor: indexes files by GetFullPath with OrdinalIgnoreCase (Windows semantics); duplicate paths keep the last index (harmless); a relative path in files is normalised against the current directory consistently with the scheduler only if the scheduler also passes full paths (CatalogEntry(f) uses f as-is, tests use absolute paths); null files would NRE but the only caller passes the same array it built entries from."
