"F01362"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/SlowLinkFileSystem.cs"	"178"	"178"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ThrottledReadStream.public override void Write(byte[] buffer, int offset, int count)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Write: throws NotSupportedException, correct for a read-only decorator (CanWrite is false)."
"F01363"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/SlowLinkFileSystem.cs"	"179"	"179"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ThrottledReadStream.public override void Flush()"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Flush: forwards inner.Flush(); harmless on a read-only stream."
"F01364"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/SlowLinkFileSystem.cs"	"181"	"185"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ThrottledReadStream.protected override void Dispose(bool disposing)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Dispose(bool): disposes the inner stream only when disposing==true and always calls base.Dispose; the inner is owned by this wrapper so there is no leak or double-dispose (inner Dispose idempotent)."
"F01365"	"src/PhotoReview.Benchmarking/SlowLinkSourceReader.cs"	"24"	"28"	"ConstructorDeclaration"	"SlowLinkSourceReader.public SlowLinkSourceReader(ISourceReader inner, SharedBandwidthLimiter? bandwidth)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"SlowLinkSourceReader ctor: rejects null inner, accepts null limiter (pass-through mode); no other state."
