"F01369"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Abstractions/IAppPaths.cs"	"33"	"33"	"PropertyDeclaration"	"IAppPaths.UserLanguagesDir.get"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Default interface property: Path.Combine(GetDirectoryName(ConfigFile) ?? """", ""Languages""). Checked ConfigFile without a directory part (gives relative ""Languages"", CWD-dependent) and invalid chars (GetDirectoryName throws ArgumentException); AppPaths always supplies an absolute ConfigFile so neither occurs in production; follows config.json when PHOTOREVIEW_ISOLATE_CONFIG moves it. Exercised through LocalizationServiceTests (App.Tests)."
