"F01408"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Caching/BoundedLruCache.cs"	"26"	"40"	"MethodDeclaration"	"BoundedLruCache.public bool TryGet(TKey key, [MaybeNullWhen(false)] out TValue value)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"TryGet moves the node to the front under _gate and returns the stored value; no value copy outside lock needed (values are immutable decoded images / byte[]). MaybeNotNull annotation satisfied (value=default on miss). Tests: LruRetainsRecentlyAccessedEntry."
"F01409"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Caching/BoundedLruCache.cs"	"42"	"60"	"MethodDeclaration"	"BoundedLruCache.public void Set(TKey key, TValue value)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Checked: size = Math.Max(1, sizeOf) so zero/negative sizes cannot disable eviction; replacement removes the old entry first even when the new value is oversize (OversizeReplacementDropsStaleEntry); eviction loop terminates because size <= capacity; sizeOf throwing leaves state untouched (called before the lock). Overflow of _size + size only if capacity is near long.MaxValue (not used). Evicted values are not disposed (IDecodedImage is not IDisposable)."
