"F01420"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Catalog/CaptureGroupBuilder.cs"	"18"	"54"	"MethodDeclaration"	"CaptureGroupBuilder.public static IReadOnlyList<CaptureGroup> Build(IEnumerable<string> imagePaths, IEnumerable<string>? sidecarPaths = null)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Checked: null imagePaths throws; blank/non-image extensions skipped; buckets keyed by (dir, basename) OrdinalIgnoreCase with Path.GetDirectoryName normalising separators so C:/a and C:\a pair; a bucket groups only with exactly 1 JPEG (.jpg/.jpeg) and exactly 1 RAW (duplicates or case-variant twins stay ungrouped, which is the safe direction); first-seen order is kept (deterministic). Edited .tif next to RAW is never the JPEG side. Tests: Build_LeavesUnpairedAndAmbiguousFilesSeparate, Build_NonJpegImageNextToRaw_IsNotGrouped, Build_MatchesSameFolderAndBasenameIgnoringCase_AndIncludesXmp."
