"F01507"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Catalog/ManagedNaturalComparer.cs"	"106"	"110"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ManagedNaturalComparer.private static int SignificantDigits(string name, int start, int end)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Skips leading ASCII 0 only; consistent with WriteKey's trimming loop, so an all-zero run yields 0 digits and prefix 0000000000."
