"F01524"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Catalog/ReviewCatalog.cs"	"198"	"236"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ReviewCatalog.public int Remove(string path)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Checked both branches: deferred path records the stored position in sorted _removedPositions (binary search insertion) and skips an O(n) rebuild, but only when no duplicate keys exist and fewer than 64 pending removals; otherwise full invalidate. Next-current: removing before current shifts index down, after keeps it, removing current picks min(removedIndex, Count-1), empty gives -1; unknown path returns CurrentIndex unchanged. Removing by a non-representative member removes the whole capture entry (by design). StructuralVersion and Paths cache updated in both branches. Differential run over random Remove/Restore/RestoreMembers/RemovePaths/ReplaceOrder with groups found no index or CurrentIndex violation. Tests: Remove_Burst_DoesNotRebuildIndexPerRemoval, Remove_PastThreshold_StillCorrect, Remove_AfterTheMaximumNumberOfIncrementalRemovals_ForcesAnIndexRebuild, Remove_EntryWhoseMemberPathIsAlsoAnotherEntry_KeepsFindingTheSurvivorByThatPath, Remove_EntryBeforeCurrent_KeepsSameCurrentPath, RandomOperations_MatchReferenceModel."
