"F01544"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Catalog/SiblingFolderService.cs"	"7"	"23"	"MethodDeclaration"	"SiblingFolderService.public static IReadOnlyList<string> GetSorted(string currentFolder, ILog? log = null)"	"ISSUE"	"Uses Directory.EnumerateDirectories(parent) which, with its default (compatible) options, includes Hidden and System directories (reproduced: a hidden .hid sibling is returned), so sibling navigation can land in tool folders such as a hidden thumbnails folder; parent null (root) returns empty; UnauthorizedAccess/IOException logged and mapped to empty (test SiblingFolders_ParentCannotBeListed_ReturnsEmptyAndLogsTheError); GetFullPath throws for null/blank input (callers validate). Natural order by folder name via the managed comparer. See W2-CC-02."
"F01545"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/Diagnostics/BenchmarkStatistics.cs"	"5"	"14"	"MethodDeclaration"	"BenchmarkStatistics.public static double Percentile(IReadOnlyList<double> values, double percentile)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Percentile: empty list returns 0, NaN or out-of-range percentile throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException via the negated range check; at percentile 1.0 upper index is n-1 (no overrun); linear interpolation checked for n=1 and n=2. NaN or double.PositiveInfinity inputs would yield NaN (inf minus inf) but benchmark durations never hold them. Tests: BenchmarkStatisticsTests (empty, out-of-range, single, two values, p50/p95)."
