"F01674"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/FileActions/ActionDestinationPolicy.cs"	"27"	"50"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ActionDestinationPolicy.public static ActionDestinationCheck Validate(string? destination)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Empty/whitespace returns Empty; the \\?\ long-path prefix is stripped before the invalid-char scan so its '?' is not rejected while a later '?'/'*' is; drive-relative 'a:b' and rooted-without-drive '\photos' fail IsPathFullyQualified; relative segments are Trim()med so '.. ' is still caught; absolute paths pass as an explicit user choice. Residual lexical gaps (junctions) are closed at run time by GetFullPath+StartsWith and ValidateNoEscapeViaReparsePoint. Tests: ActionDestinationPolicyTests, ActionDestinationRootTests."
"F01675"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/FileActions/ActionDestinationPolicy.cs"	"63"	"89"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ActionDestinationPolicy.public static ActionDestinationCheck ValidateNoEscapeViaReparsePoint( string sourceFolder, string destinationFolderOrPath, IFileSystem fileSystem)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Resolves BOTH source folder and destination with fs.ResolveRealPath and fails CLOSED (EscapesSourceFolder) on IOException/UnauthorizedAccessException (RV-S06 link loop); containment uses realSource + separator so C:\ph does not prefix-match C:\photos2; drive-root source 'C:\' trims to 'C:' and re-adds the separator correctly; equal paths are Ok. An ArgumentException (NUL in path) would propagate, but both callers sit inside ExecuteAsync/ExecuteGroupAsync try blocks and fail before any mutation. Tests: DestinationEscapeTests, SymlinkDestinationEscapeNativeTests, PhysicalFileSystemReparseTests."
"F01676"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/FileActions/ActionDestinationPolicy.cs"	"96"	"107"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ActionDestinationPolicy.public static PickedFolderCheck ValidatePickedFolder(string? destination, string photoFolder, Func<string, bool> directoryExists)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Reuses Validate and additionally requires IsPathFullyQualified, so a relative or drive-relative pick is NotAbsolute; compares GetFullPath+TrimEndingDirectorySeparator with OrdinalIgnoreCase to catch SameAsPhotoFolder; existence via injected directoryExists (no I/O of its own). null photoFolder/directoryExists throw; an empty photoFolder string would make GetFullPath throw ArgumentException (callers pass the loaded folder). Tests: PickedFolderPolicyTests."
