"F01935"	"src/PhotoReview.Core/IO/NavigationStatWorker.cs"	"33"	"68"	"MethodDeclaration"	"NavigationStatWorker.public Task<T> RunAsync<T>(Func<T> work, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)"	"UNREVIEWED"	"Static trace needs controlled evidence; Enqueue is correct (pre-cancelled token short-circuits, work exceptions fault only that task). Suspect: one FIFO thread with no per-item timeout, and a token cancelled AFTER enqueue is only honoured at dequeue, so a stalled SMB stat blocks every later navigation stat (even after switching to a local folder) and cancelled awaiters stay pending until it returns. Documented intent is only to keep the UI thread free. Not reproduced (needs a stalled share). Tests cover pre-cancelled and queued-cancel only. See finding N-core-io-F05."
