"F03024"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"15"	"16"	"MethodDeclaration"	"RulesConfig.public double Get(string rule, string key, double @default)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Get: returns the configured number when both rule and key exist, otherwise the caller's default; rule and key lookups are case-sensitive (JSON keys must match exactly, a typo silently falls back to the default); no range validation, so a negative or zero threshold from the rules file is accepted. Covered by PerfAnalyzeTests.RulesConfigOverridesDefaultThresholds."
"F03025"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"18"	"35"	"MethodDeclaration"	"RulesConfig.public static RulesConfig Load(string path)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Load: File.ReadAllText then Deserialize into a nullable-section map; JsonException (bad JSON, wrong value types) is wrapped in InvalidDataException naming the file, null sections mean defaults, a top-level JSON null yields an empty config; a missing file surfaces as FileNotFoundException and a directory path as UnauthorizedAccessException (unwrapped, fine for CLI). Covered by RulesConfigOverridesDefaultThresholds and BenchmarkReportFormattingTests.PerfAnalyzeArguments_BadRulesAreRejected (argument side)."
"F03026"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"37"	"37"	"MethodDeclaration"	"RulesConfig.public static RulesConfig Default()"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Default: empty config so every Get returns its built-in default; trivial."
"F03027"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"54"	"55"	"MethodDeclaration"	"PerfRules.private static string FmtMs(double? value)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"FmtMs: null or NaN renders N/A, otherwise F1 invariant with ms suffix, so evidence never prints empty text or NaN. Covered by PerfAnalyzeReportTests.RUiEvidenceShowsNaForAnAbsentRamHitP95 and RFolderEvidenceShowsNaForMissingT1AndT3."
"F03028"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"60"	"73"	"MethodDeclaration"	"PerfRules.public static RuleResult EvaluateRIo(RulesConfig cfg, IReadOnlyList<NavRecord> sourceMissNavs)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"EvaluateRIo: eligible navs need FinalVisualMs>0 (no divide by zero) and TReadMs; N/A with an explanatory note when none (t_read only exists under PHOTOREVIEW_DIAG_PREREAD); averages per-nav ratios not a ratio of sums, threshold default 40 percent; invariant formatting. Affected indirectly by PA-01 (t_read share itself is unaffected, the t_decode side is). Covered by PerfAnalyzeTests.RIoTriggersOnHighIoShareAndIsNotTriggeredBelowThreshold and RIoIsNotApplicableWithoutReadTiming."
