"F03031"	"src/PhotoReview.PerfAnalysis/PerfAnalyzeRules.cs"	"76"	"85"	"MethodDeclaration"	"PerfRules.public static RuleResult EvaluateRDec(RulesConfig cfg, IReadOnlyList<NavRecord> decodeNavs)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"EvaluateRDec: same eligibility pattern (FinalVisualMs>0 and TDecodeMs present), N/A when none, avg share vs decodeSharePct default 40; the TDecodeMs input is biased low under PHOTOREVIEW_DIAG_PREREAD because of PA-01. Covered by RDecTriggersOnHighDecodeShareAndIsNotTriggeredBelowThreshold."
