"F03090"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"45"	"45"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int EnumNext(IntPtr self, uint count, IntPtr[] items, out uint fetched)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IEnumIDList::Next is slot 3 and EnumNextDelegate takes [Out] IntPtr[] (blittable, pinned) plus out uint fetched, as Next(ULONG, PITEMID_CHILD*, ULONG*) requires. The wrapper does not bound count against items.Length, but its single caller passes children.Length. No direct test."
"F03091"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"47"	"47"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int QueryService(IntPtr self, ref Guid service, ref Guid iid, out IntPtr result)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IServiceProvider::QueryService is slot 3 with (REFGUID, REFIID, void**); delegate uses ref Guid for both GUIDs and out IntPtr, so no marshalling copy issue. Caller releases browserPtr in its finally. No direct test."
"F03092"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"48"	"48"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int QueryActiveShellView(IntPtr self, out IntPtr view)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IShellBrowser::QueryActiveShellView = slot 15 (IOleWindow 3-4, InsertMenusSB 5 ... SendControlMsg 14, QueryActiveShellView 15); out IntPtr is an AddRef'ed IShellView released by the caller's finally. No direct test."
"F03093"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"49"	"49"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int ItemCount(IntPtr self, uint flags, out int count)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IFolderView::ItemCount is slot 7 (flags uint, out int); the caller treats hr<0 or count<=0 as NativeViewUnavailable(EmptyView), so an empty folder or a failing call never reaches the enumeration. No direct test."
"F03094"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"50"	"50"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int GetGroupBy(IntPtr self, out PROPERTYKEY key, out bool ascending)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IFolderView2::GetGroupBy slot 18 (IFolderView ends at 16, SetGroupBy 17); PROPERTYKEY out plus BOOL marshalled as 4-byte Bool. A failing HRESULT is mapped to 'not grouped' by the caller, see P-EXP-01 on TryReadNativeView (the wrapper itself is correct)."
"F03095"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"51"	"51"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int GetSortColumnCount(IntPtr self, out int count)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IFolderView2::GetSortColumnCount slot 26 (GetCurrentFolderFlags 25 then 26); out int. ReadSortColumns bounds the result to 1..32 before allocating, so a bogus count cannot drive a huge array."
"F03096"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"52"	"52"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static int GetSortColumns(IntPtr self, SORTCOLUMN[] columns, int count)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IFolderView2::GetSortColumns slot 28 (SetSortColumns 27); SORTCOLUMN {PROPERTYKEY{Guid,uint}, int} is blittable sequential, so [Out] array pinning is safe; caller passes native.Length as count so no overrun. No direct test."
"F03097"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"53"	"53"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static GetItemDelegate ResolveGetItem(IntPtr self)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IFolderView2::GetItem slot 29 resolved once per view; delegate (self, int index, ref Guid iid, out IntPtr) matches GetItem(int, REFIID, void**). Returned delegate is reused only against folderViewPtr (same vtable) as the per-item loop does."
"F03098"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"54"	"54"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.internal static GetDisplayNameDelegate ResolveGetDisplayName(IntPtr self)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"IShellItem::GetDisplayName slot 5 (BindToHandler 3, GetParent 4); delegate (self, uint sigdn, out IntPtr name). Per-item loop caches the delegate per distinct vtable address, so a heterogeneous item implementation cannot receive a delegate bound to another vtable."
"F03099"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/Explorer/ExplorerComInterop.cs"	"56"	"61"	"MethodDeclaration"	"ExplorerNativeVtable.private static T Get<T>(IntPtr self, int slot) where T : Delegate"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Generic slot reader: ReadIntPtr(self) then ReadIntPtr(vtable, slot*IntPtr.Size) then GetDelegateForFunctionPointer<T>. Correct pointer arithmetic for x64. A null self would AV, but every caller guards IntPtr.Zero first. Allocates a new delegate per call (perf only, per-item path resolves once per vtable)."
