"F03185"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsDarkTitleBar.cs"	"35"	"41"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsDarkTitleBar.public static bool TryEnableDarkMode(IntPtr handle)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Zero handle returns false; tries DWMWA 20 then the legacy 19 with the same value and treats any non-S_OK HRESULT as false; DllNotFound/EntryPointNotFound caught. Informational only (callers ignore false). Test: WindowsDarkTitleBarEnablesDarkModeOnARealHandle."
"F03186"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsDarkTitleBar.cs"	"47"	"56"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsDarkTitleBar.public static bool TrySetCaptionColor(IntPtr handle, uint colorBgr)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Zero handle false; passes the COLORREF (BGR) uint by ref with size 4 to DWMWA_CAPTION_COLOR (35, Windows 11 only, E_INVALIDARG elsewhere returns false); missing dwmapi caught. A value with high bits set is rejected by DWM and reported false. No dedicated test."
