"F03201"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsMemoryProbe.cs"	"34"	"35"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsMemoryProbe.public bool HasHeadroom(double maximumLoad, long reserveBytes)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Delegates to the pure rule with the freshly taken snapshot; no caching, so each call costs one GlobalMemoryStatusEx (cheap, no disk). Test: WindowsMemoryProbeReportsRealisticMetrics."
"F03202"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsMemoryProbe.cs"	"43"	"47"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsMemoryProbe.public static bool EvaluateHeadroom(MemorySnapshot? snapshot, double maximumLoad, long reserveBytes)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Fail-closed on null snapshot; load strictly below maximumLoad*100 (a NaN maximumLoad compares false = no headroom); negative reserve clamped with Math.Max before the ulong cast (RV-P06 wrap bug closed). Tests: EvaluateHeadroom_NullSnapshot_ReportsNoHeadroom, EvaluateHeadroom_ReserveBoundary, EvaluateHeadroom_NegativeReserve_TreatedAsZero, EvaluateHeadroom_LoadAtOrAboveLimit_ReportsNoHeadroom."
"F03203"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsMemoryProbe.cs"	"49"	"55"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsMemoryProbe.public MemorySnapshot? GetSnapshot()"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"MEMORYSTATUSEX layout checked (4+4+7x8 = 64 bytes, Length set from Marshal.SizeOf); SetLastError=true and GetLastWin32Error read immediately in the failure branch; failure logs and returns null which EvaluateHeadroom turns into no headroom."
"F03204"	"src/PhotoReview.Platform.Windows/WindowsNaturalComparer.cs"	"16"	"38"	"MethodDeclaration"	"WindowsNaturalComparer.public int Compare(string? x, string? y)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Reference/null ordering handled before the P/Invoke; StrCmpLogicalW truncates at an embedded NUL so equal-looking results fall back to OrdinalIgnoreCase, which still separates them; only DllNotFound/EntryPointNotFound fall back to the managed comparer (CORE-12). Fuzzed 220 random names: 0 transitivity and 0 antisymmetry violations (evidence/F03116-natural-comparer-fuzz.cs.txt), so no inconsistent-comparer risk for List.Sort was found. Test: WindowsNaturalComparerOrdersNaturally."
